{"title":"비밀투표","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bcNzTz/hAd4yOziJP/bwEp2v4b0os8SF9fp6A9U0&filename=th3","synopsis":"밤이 되면 한 명씩 죽는다. 서로의 잘못을 찾아낼 때까지.\n\"최종 용의자를 처형하겠다.\"\n고등학교 졸업 후 각자 제자리에서 평범한 삶을 살고 있던 일행들.\n\n그러던 어느 날, 정체불명의 사내에게 납치당하게 되고,\n정신을 차려보니 낡은 유스호스텔에 구속되어 있었다.\n \n그런 그들에게 하루에 한 명씩 최종 용의자를 처형할 테니\n다짜고짜 피의자를 찾기 위한 투표를 하라고 하는데...\n\n과연 일행들은 피의자를 찾고 무사히 탈출할 수 있을까?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":294,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":246,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":281,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":295,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-07","rank":286,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":241,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":239,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":226,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":226,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":226,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":226,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":228,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":228,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":228,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":231,"change":{"type